{"ID":"20240118151103-x16vhm1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151103-x16vhm1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151103-x16vhm1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151104-25wvgzr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122140115-q40e7v5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122140115-q40e7v5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:441,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:441\u0026#125;","title":"228犀角","type":"doc","updated":"20240201175349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151104-25wvgzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151104-25wvgzr","updated":"20240122140051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治百毒，蛊疰，邪鬼，瘴气，杀钩吻，鸩羽，蛇毒，除邪，不迷惑，魇寐，外服轻身。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140055-nykax0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140055-nykax0a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国云南贵州四川等地，生山谷中，角入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140057-01xedwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140057-01xedwe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦酸咸，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140059-tklc62k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140059-tklc62k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】犀角为散邪清热凉血解毒要药，主伤寒时疫，发黄发斑，风毒中恶，狂言妄语，治胃中大热，痘疮黑陷，吐血下血，蓄血谵语，能消痈化脓，解毒定惊。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140101-a2nyfk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140101-a2nyfk6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】伤寒瘟疫头痛寒热诸毒气，令人骏健。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140103-sc7tgjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140103-sc7tgjk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药性】辟中恶毒气，镇心神，解大热，散风毒，治发背痈疽疮肿，化脓作水，疗时疾热如火，烦毒入心，狂言妄语。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140105-luvhdeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140105-luvhdeo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】养心开窍，解毒除邪。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140108-q33nxdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140108-q33nxdy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通三分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140109-6owidcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140109-6owidcf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶乌头，忌盐，能消胎气，孕妇忌服，痘疮气虚无大热，伤寒阴症发躁，脉沉细，足冷，渴而饮不多，且复吐出者均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140054-9ih2chz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140054-9ih2chz"}},{"ID":"20240122140110-h32vbn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140110-h32vbn0"}},{"ID":"20240122140110-78av3h0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140110-78av3h0","updated":"20240201175234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"228犀角就是犀牛角，现在这个药呢，已经禁用了。国际都列为国际保护动物，但是在我的抽屈里还有犀角哦，为什么？动物园的园丁送给我的，因为他在动物园是专门负责清理东西的，他腰痛都找我治，他说你要犀角很简单呀，我们那个犀角没事就在树上挂，因为角很粗啊，它要常常去刮嘛，一刮就一片一片的刮下来了，掉在那边，你要的话我捡些给你。那很好啊，反正他不要了，犀牛也不会说你怎么可以拿我的犀角，对不对，就把它捡扫起来统统给我，放在抽屈里好多犀角。他说这个是黑的，这个是白的，都给我讲，动物里面有。动物园里面那个园丁你跟他好好地相处，他会拿犀角给你，但是放心，他不是杀犀牛。"}]},{"ID":"20240122140115-q40e7v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140115-q40e7v5","updated":"20240201175349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个专门治百毒，犀牛在森林里面呢是个救火队员，它看到那边失火，它的欲望就是要灭火，他非要把那个火踩灭掉，所以一物克一物，所以它寒，非常地寒哦，那过去呢因为他是性寒的，所以它能够善清邪热，过去南派遇到壮热，高热病的时候就开犀角一钱。那现在犀角禁用了，所以南派的不会治高热了，看到你高热，就叫他去打点滴。打什么点滴呀，不要打点滴，我们用石膏啊，很多很多去热的药，一剂就把那个热退掉了，不需要用到犀牛角。张仲景在1800年前，他也没有用到犀牛角呀，解大热的话我们有很多的药可以解大热，能消痈化脓，解毒定惊的药也有很多，黄连也解毒甘草也解毒。那黄连和甘草有什么不一样，很简单呀我们前面讲过，甘草解百草的毒，黄连苦味的入心，任何东西能够达到心脏里面，能够造成心脏毒害，用黄连就可以解呀。尿毒实际上并不是在洗肾呀，是心肺透析，把心脏的血拿出来把里面的尿毒洗掉，再把它放回心脏里面。所以黄连是解尿毒用的，那你说哎老师用甘草解尿毒行不行？这两个不对症。所以诸位只要想它的药性，苦味的入心，任何能毒害心脏的就是黄连可以解，食物中毒是用甘草。以前道士用犀角画符用，所以用途也很多，现在我们不用了。"}]}]}